# 🚀 TeamWeave Browser - Quick Start

## ⚡ In 30 Seconds

1. **Open File**
   ```
   C:\Users\aryan\source\repos\TeamWeave\index.html
   ```
   → Double-click it → Browser opens automatically

2. **Register Participants**
   - Click "➕ Register Participant"
   - Fill name, email, select skills
   - Click "Register"

3. **Create Teams**
   - Click "🔄 Run Clustering"
   - Set team size (default: 4)
   - Click "Run Clustering"

4. **View & Export**
   - Click "Teams" tab to see results
   - Click "📥 Export" to download CSV

---

## 🎮 Main Commands

| Action | Steps |
|--------|-------|
| **Open App** | Double-click `index.html` |
| **Register** | Dashboard → "➕ Register Participant" → Fill form → Register |
| **Cluster** | Dashboard → "🔄 Run Clustering" → Set size → Run |
| **View Participants** | Click "Participants" tab |
| **View Teams** | Click "Teams" tab |
| **Lock Team** | Teams tab → "[🔒 Lock]" button |
| **Export** | Dashboard → "📥 Export..." |
| **Filter** | Participants tab → Select category |
| **View History** | Click "Audit Trail" tab |
| **Refresh** | Auto-refreshes every 10 seconds |

